  "_doc": "Figma variable <-> code token. Code is canonical for VALUES; this map records only the correspondence. Filled by hand from a live read, by whoever is doing the work — there is no skill that sweeps the file, because a scheduled sweep would imply an authority the design canvas does not have. See ../README.md. A variable with `code: null` is drift — Figma has a variable with no token behind it. RESCANNED 2026-09-09: the file has 154 variables in 6 collections, not the 87 in 5 collections previously recorded elsewhere (see docs/research/0003-figma-token-inventory.md). Every `code` below is null because no DTCG token files exist yet under packages/tokens/tokens/ — that is the honest state, not a gap in this scan.",
